		</value>
	</Operation>

	<Operation Class="PatchOperationReplace">
		<xpath>Defs/ThingDef[defName="ZF_BlocksBasalt"]/description</xpath>
		<value>
			<description>Recommended: Defensive construction, Tree-cutting tools (fair)
    
Durability: Fairly good
